# Static-asset response headers (Workers Static Assets reads this file; it does not
# apply to responses the Worker code generates).
#
# /models/* holds the Pocket TTS weights, tokenizer and voice embeddings mirrored by
# scripts/fetch-model-assets.ts. Every path under it carries a prefix of its own SHA-256
# (src/modelAssets.ts), so the bytes at a URL never change: a year-long immutable
# lifetime is exact, not optimistic. The open CORS header lets the synthesis worker on
# any origin — a local dev page against production assets included — read them.
/models/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable
  Access-Control-Allow-Origin: *
